  title: [Modelado e identificación de patrones en flujos o procedimientos de trámite en Bolivia],
  abstract: [
    Many efforts are made to implement a digital version of different "trámites" in Bolivia. However, many of these bureaucratic procedures can be modeled in similar ways, helping future efforts to stop reinventing the wheel. In this article we explore some of these similarities and model them according to 4 aspects: cases, resources, processes and tasks.
